*Formula Sheet: Spin & Angular Momentum*

- *Spin-1/2 Operators & Pauli Matrices:*
  $ S_i = planck/2 sigma_i $
  $ sigma_x = mat(0, 1; 1, 0), quad sigma_y = mat(0, -i; i, 0), quad sigma_z = mat(1, 0; 0, -1) $

- *Spin-1/2 Eigenstates:*
  $ |+z chevron.r = mat(1; 0), quad |-z chevron.r = mat(0; 1) $

- *Angular Momentum Commutation & Ladder Algebra:*
  $ [S_x, S_y] = i planck S_z, quad [S_y, S_z] = i planck S_x, quad [S_z, S_x] = i planck S_y $
  $ S_plus.minus = S_x plus.minus i S_y $
  $ S^2 |s, m chevron.r = s(s+1) planck^2 |s, m chevron.r $
  $ S_z |s, m chevron.r = m planck |s, m chevron.r $
  $ S_plus.minus |s, m chevron.r = planck sqrt(s(s+1) - m(m plus.minus 1)) |s, m plus.minus 1 chevron.r $
